The configuration files in this directory are based on the docker-compose
configuration of the walt.id identity stack (https://github.com/walt-id/waltid-identity),
Copyright walt.id GmbH, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
(http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0). They have been trimmed and changed
for this project: one Danish PID credential profile, service hostnames and ports,
and in-memory storage.

The keys and certificates in them are walt.id's public test material. Use them for
local demos only.
